Statement of changes (TOST-1.0 / Apache-2.0 Section 4(b)): the OpenSubdiv
files named in each Rust module's documentation were translated from C++ to
Rust and modified (restructured, partly reimplemented, with the deviations
listed in README.md under "Fidelity notes"). The WGSL shaders in
opensubdiv-wgpu translate parts of OpenSubdiv's Osd layer. This project is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Pixar or the OpenSubdiv contributors.

